Objective: Win in 20 turns

Planet: Hammerhead
Clan: Ayer's Hand

Notes: The side with the most points by turn 20 will be declared victorious. The green team controlled by the computer has 2 eco-spheres, as well as a number of vehicle plants operating. The human side has only one eco-sphere operating and no production capability.

The game must be won with the force already in place.  Red team does enjoy four refineries and a significant refined gold credit available for instant upgrades. The only way to come on top in points by turn 20 appears to be to destroy the 2 enemy eco-spheres. The question though, in light of the green team's formidable defenses, is how?

